# indo-audio-transcribe — .gitignore
#
# Three things must never be committed here: recording audio, transcripts, and
# local machine state. A recording is somebody's speech and a transcript is their
# words; both are private by default, which is why nothing in this category has a
# tracked exception.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- audio input
# Users' recordings. The repo ships none, and the parity suite reads its reference
# from the environment instead (MYTRANSCRIBE_REFERENCE_AUDIO).
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.wav
*.flac
*.ogg
*.opus
*.wma
*.amr
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi

# Generated audio: the 16 kHz mono working file, and kept copies of it.
*.16k.wav

# Reference pair for the slow parity suite, when placed in the repo root.
reference.mp3
reference.txt

# ------------------------------------------------------------- transcripts out
# Transcripts are output, not source. Keep the tree free of them.
*.srt
*.vtt
hasil.*
transkrip.*

# Private scratch space for personal recordings kept during development.
.private-backup/

# ----------------------------------------------------------- python / runtime
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.so
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/

# Tool caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml

# --------------------------------------------------- managed app process state
# `serve.sh` writes its pid and log here; Jobs keep temp audio here.
.run/
.jobs/
*.pid
*.log

# --------------------------------------------------------------- local config
# Nobody's personal environment settings belong in a shared repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ editor/os
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --------------------------------------------------------------- issue tracker
# Local Beads/Dolt state, if used. The tracker is a working tool, not the product.
.beads/
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
.beads/proxieddb/
.scratch/

# -------------------------------------------------------- usability fixtures
# Derived from a user-supplied recording by a fixture script, never committed.
.uat/